:''For the old event, see [[Dark Descent Stages]].''
'''Cover of Darkness''' (闇討ちの戦い, ''Yamiuchi Chino Tatakai'', '''Battle of Darkness''') is a group of special stages appearing during special occasions. It was added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]].

==Event Information==
Each stage includes [[Timed Score Reward]]s which feature [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark Enemies]] exclusively. All stages feature XP and a [[Cat Capsule#Normal Cat Capsule|Cat Ticket]], and [[Western Walk (Cover of Darkness)|Western Walk]] and [[Final Battleground]] also drop a Rare Ticket.

